    given-names: Nachuan

repository-code: "https://github.com/Nigel886/MIND"

license: MIT

version: "1.0.0"

abstract: >
  MIND (Meta-Inference Network Dynamics) is a specification-driven research
  prototype containing immutable cognitive state progression, bounded
  goal-directed execution, deterministic Meta-Inference capability selection,
  and controlled LLM-assisted session admission. It does not claim general
  intelligence, adaptive learning, real-provider performance, or comparative
  superiority.
